"><span data-lake-id=\"u398334db\" id=\"u398334db\">经过一段时间之后, 人为的查看是否达到预期的90°</span></li><li fid=\"uba93a379\" data-lake-id=\"u4d0a95e3\" id=\"u4d0a95e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2fc375fe\" id=\"u2fc375fe\">若达到了,则立即关闭电机</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ubbecbbae\" id=\"ubbecbbae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9089dc45\" id=\"u9089dc45\">按照这样的想法, 我们可以得到如下代码:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20common_control_1()%7B%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%3A%20%E8%AE%A9%E8%88%B5%E6%9C%BA%E8%BD%AC90%E5%BA%A6%202496%2F4%20%3D%20624%5Cn%5Ctwhile(1)%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctmotor_set_pwm(1000)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%99%A8%E8%AF%BB%E6%95%B0%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctshort%20enc%20%3D%20encoder_get()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctif(enc%20%3E%3D%20624)%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctmotor_set_pwm(0)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctdelay_1ms(100)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctenc%20%3D%20encoder_get()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctprintf(%5C%22last%20enc%3A%25d%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cenc)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctbreak%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%7D%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XNk1T%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u18086559\" id=\"u18086559\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6a2b1f3f\" id=\"u6a2b1f3f\"><br></p>",
